---
import Layout from "@/layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
    seo={{
        title: "Intelligent Dynamic Pricing — Inmaculada Osuna",
        description: "Interurban transport capacity optimization using Deep Reinforcement Learning.",
    }}
>
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-10 py-12 max-w-3xl mx-auto antialiased">
        <div>
            <a href="/en/projects" class="text-sm font-semibold text-rose-500 hover:text-rose-600 transition-colors inline-flex items-center gap-1.5">
                <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M10 19l-7-7m0 0l7-7m-7 7h18"></path></svg>
                Back to Projects
            </a>
        </div>

        <header class="flex flex-col border-b border-neutral-200 dark:border-neutral-800 pb-8">
            <div class="mb-5">
                <span class="px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-bold tracking-widest text-rose-600 bg-rose-50 border border-rose-200 rounded-full dark:bg-rose-900/20 dark:text-rose-400 dark:border-rose-800/50">DEEP RL & BIG DATA</span>
            </div>
            
            <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-neutral-900 dark:text-white mb-3">
                Intelligent Dynamic Pricing System
            </h1>
            
            <span class="text-base font-medium text-neutral-500 dark:text-neutral-400 mb-6 flex items-center gap-2">
                <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 14l9-5-9-5-9 5 9 5z"></path><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 14l9-5-9-5-9 5 9 5zm0 0v7"></path></svg>
                Master's Thesis (TFM) — UCM (Madrid)
            </span>
            
            <p class="text-lg sm:text-xl text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-400 leading-relaxed max-w-2xl">
                Capacity optimization and pricing engines in interurban transport using Deep Reinforcement Learning architectures.
            </p>
        </header>

        <div class="flex flex-col gap-10 text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-400 leading-relaxed">
            <section class="flex flex-col gap-3">
                <h3 class="font-bold text-neutral-900 dark:text-white text-xl flex items-center gap-2">
                    <span class="text-rose-500">◆</span> Context & Architecture
                </h3>
                <p>
                    Managing seat allocation and pricing dynamically in railway networks requires processing large volumes of historical booking data while continuously adapting to volatile demand patterns. This project implements an intelligent pricing engine built on top of distributed data processing pipelines.
                </p>
            </section>

            <section class="flex flex-col gap-3">
                <h3 class="font-bold text-neutral-900 dark:text-white text-xl flex items-center gap-2">
                    <span class="text-rose-500">◆</span> Tech Stack & Implementation
                </h3>
                <p>
                    Data processing and feature engineering were handled using <strong>PySpark</strong> to manage distributed datasets efficiently. The core optimization model relies on <strong>Deep Reinforcement Learning (DeepRL)</strong> agents trained to maximize revenue and seat occupancy under varying demand constraints. A fully interactive dashboard was built using <strong>Streamlit</strong> to simulate live pricing adjustments.
                </p>
            </section>

            <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3 pt-2">
                <span class="px-4 py-2 text-xs font-bold text-neutral-700 bg-neutral-100 border border-neutral-200 rounded-xl dark:bg-neutral-800 dark:text-neutral-300 dark:border-neutral-700 shadow-sm">PySpark</span>
                <span class="px-4 py-2 text-xs font-bold text-neutral-700 bg-neutral-100 border border-neutral-200 rounded-xl dark:bg-neutral-800 dark:text-neutral-300 dark:border-neutral-700 shadow-sm">Deep Reinforcement Learning</span>
                <span class="px-4 py-2 text-xs font-bold text-neutral-700 bg-neutral-100 border border-neutral-200 rounded-xl dark:bg-neutral-800 dark:text-neutral-300 dark:border-neutral-700 shadow-sm">Streamlit</span>
                <span class="px-4 py-2 text-xs font-bold text-neutral-700 bg-neutral-100 border border-neutral-200 rounded-xl dark:bg-neutral-800 dark:text-neutral-300 dark:border-neutral-700 shadow-sm">Big Data</span>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</Layout>